a3  003 (P2) — SKIPPED. The current wording ("Kai kuriuose nuosprendžiuose … skirta apie 3 mėnesių bausmė; tipiškos ar garantuotos baigties nėra.") is exactly what RULEBOOK-FIX R3 prescribes for this sentence. The suggested "teismai šiuo metu paprastai skiria" restores the typical-outcome claim, which ACCEPTED-ROUND forbids ("Requests to make a … result sentence positive → never"). Same for the serious-injury / death line.
a8, b50 — SKIPPED (thousands "500.000" → "500 000"). ACCEPTED-ROUND: "Requests for space thousands separators ('500 000') … → skip (the checker cannot parse them)"; R14 pins dot-thousands for lt. Left unchanged in 001, 002, 003, 004, 006, 007, 010, 011, 017, 018.
a9, b18 — SKIPPED (remove the U+200B-only paragraphs in 003/005/006/008/013/015). The checker compares ZWSP count and block count against the canonical source `src/content/columns/`, which CONTAINS those characters (003 SRC=52 LT=52, 005 8/8, 006 4/4, 008 10/10, 013 5/5, 015 3/3). Measured:
