        blocks   FAIL   blocks 60 → 56
                        ZWSP 5 → 0
        summary  FAIL  0/1 files
    Removing them therefore breaks the gate; this is a source-parity matter for the supervisor, not a locale fix.
a10 006 — SKIPPED (blank line before the trailing byline). The byline is an lt-only addition glued to the last source block; adding the blank line splits a block:
