b52 P3 012 — SKIPPED. The reviewer conditions it himself ("The site uses the bare form throughout, so change it only if the whole locale is changed"): bare *kontora* is the established term in all 18 columns AND in the guidance pack (`Kontora dirba pagal Taivano teisę…`). A locale-wide rename is a supervisor decision, not a single-row fix.
